Documentation/
Wiki/

# Build directories
build/
build-*/
dist/
node_modules/
*.o
*.a

# Sandbox artifact: files a stale `dist/` build left behind that the mounted
# FUSE filesystem refuses to `unlink` (rename works, delete doesn't — same
# EPERM class noted in Design/execution/PROGRESS.md's H4/dueling-tree DT2
# gates). Renamed out of `dist/` so `vite build`'s emptyOutDir doesn't trip
# over them; ignored here so they never show up as untracked.
.build-artifact-stale-undeletable*

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json

